      ],
      "source": "https://vermont.com/cities/wilder/"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Wilder Village Historic District was listed on the National Register of Historic Places in 1999 for its unique urban design.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        17,
        20
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wilder%2C_Vermont"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Charles Wilder funded the Wilder Club and Library, a Colonial Revival building dedicated in 1899 as a social and cultural hub.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
