      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/wilder_vermont"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The original paper mill in Wilder closed after a 1927 strike and became the modern Wilder Power Station hydroelectric plant in 1950.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
